{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-25T06:24:01.091Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Both verifies pass.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented change 077 task 2 (impact lint) entirely within the task scope.\n\n**New modules**\n- `src/core/spec/test-impact.ts` — frozen-test reach warning (once per task, nearest-first, capped listing with `and N more`) and verify-without-scope-test warning, on task 1's `reachImporters`/`reachImports`.\n- `src/core/spec/capability-impact.ts` — reads living specs with `parseCodeOwnership`, matches with `scopeCoversPath`; undeclared capability read warning and capability-write-without-delta warning.\n- `src/core/spec/impact-lint.ts` — single `collectImpactFindings` entrypoint running both modules and returning `LintFinding` warnings.\n\n**Wiring**\n- `config.ts`: `importGraphDepth: 2`, `maxListedImporters: 8`.\n- `linter.ts`: `LintOptions.importGraph`, `lintChangeFolder` builds its own when absent and adds each impact finding as the change's own.\n- `cli/lint.ts`: builds the graph once with `buildImportGraph`, skipping the OpenSpec root, and passes it to every change.\n- `README.md`: four new warning rows.\n\n**Tests** — `tests/impact-lint.test.ts` (11 passing) covers every scenario: two-level reach, declared-for-modification suppression, short-list text, `maxListedImporters` cap, depth-3 reach, undeclared read and its clearing via `features.reads`, write without delta, verify warning and non-firing, Python-only repo via `lintCommand`, and two changes linted with one graph.\n\n`node --import tsx --test tests/impact-lint.test.ts` → 11 pass; `pnpm verify` → exit 0. Result written to `.run/results/2.md`."}}
